# --- browser + media -------------------------------------------------------
# Vivaldi installs from the staged upstream .deb in 52-vivaldi.sh and remains
# the default browser. Real, official Google Chrome for arm64 Linux (public
# since Q2 2026, via Google's own signed apt repo) is the second browser —
# build-desktop-mirror folds it into the offline desktop pool, pinned +
# SHA256-verified against Google's published Packages index; no live apt
# source on the shipped image, no snapd. ungoogled-chromium/XtraDeb (an
# earlier stop-gap from before real Chrome existed for arm64) is dropped —
# real Chrome supersedes it outright.
# chromium-ncz-sky1 is OUR Chromium build (V4L2-M2M hardware decode, which no
# upstream or distro arm64 build provides on Sky1). It is the default browser
# and is pinned on the launcher alongside Chrome and the terminal, but it was
# neither seeded here nor present in the forky mirror -- so the launcher would
# have pinned a browser the image never installed.
chromium-ncz-sky1
google-chrome-stable
mpv

