librsvg2-bin
imagemagick
whiptail
# rsyslog removed: the installed system is journald-only. 36-telemetry
# drops ForwardToSyslog=no + caps SystemMaxUse so journald is the single
# syslog sink. 58-boot-hygiene apt-purges the Debian default rsyslog
# pull-in so /var/log/{syslog,messages} never appears.

